    "A GitHub repository holding one folder per extension, laid out like raycast/extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个 GitHub 仓库，每个扩展对应一个文件夹，布局类似 raycast/extensions。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom command with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已存在同名的自定义命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder holding package.json and the built command files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含 package.json 和已构建命令文件的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pattern without a slash matches any file or folder name, like *.tmp or node_modules; one with a slash matches the whole path, like **/[Cc]ache/**. The built-in patterns always apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不含斜杠的模式会匹配任意文件或文件夹名称，例如 *.tmp 或 node_modules；含斜杠的模式会匹配完整路径，例如 **/[Cc]ache/**。内置模式始终生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quicklink with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已存在同名的快速链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A repository with one folder per extension, laid out like raycast/extensions. These serve source, so installing one builds it here — dependencies first, with the package manager above. Add a registry only if you trust who publishes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仓库中每个扩展对应一个文件夹，布局类似 raycast/extensions。这里提供的是源码，安装时会先用上方选择的包管理器安装依赖，再在本机完成构建。仅添加你信任的发布者所维护的仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shortcut works even when its command is hidden from the launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使命令在启动器中隐藏，快捷键仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny, native macOS launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻巧的原生 macOS 启动器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
