    "Extensions are third-party JavaScript, run on this Mac. A running command holds a JavaScript engine in memory until you leave it — expect Tinycast to use noticeably more RAM while one is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展是运行在这台 Mac 上的第三方 JavaScript。命令运行期间会一直在内存中保留 JavaScript 引擎，直到你退出该命令；因此打开扩展时，Tinycast 的内存占用会明显增加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extensions from a repository are source: installing one runs your package manager and the extension's own build script on this Mac.": {
